# Brand reference/content images — kept on disk, NOT pushed. Render uses only brand/logos/* +
# Thumbnail/Thumbnail.png + DESIGN.md; the rest (AI art, thumbnail variants, social carousel, source
# photos) is brand archive with 0 code refs. (Proposal PDFs already covered by *.pdf above.)
7_ASSETS/brand/SEOSONA/*.png
7_ASSETS/brand/SEOSONA/Thumbnail/*
!7_ASSETS/brand/SEOSONA/Thumbnail/Thumbnail.png
7_ASSETS/brand/SEOSONA/carousel*/
token.pickle
*.pem
*.key

# 1_CONFIG real secrets — keep ONLY the *.example.json templates
1_CONFIG/credentials/*.json
!1_CONFIG/credentials/*.example.json

